        <field name="sequence">2</field>
        <field name="completion_time">0.25</field>
        <field name="description">Course overview and learning goals.</field>
        <field
            name="html_content"
        ><![CDATA[
<h2>About the course The Art of Creating Backgrounds</h2>
<p>This course is the gateway to background design in animation. You will not only learn specific techniques, but also the principles that turn a simple background into an essential piece of visual storytelling.</p>
<p>We start with the foundation of good background design: lines, shapes and perspective. We then go deeper into how those tools convey emotion and intensify the story. You will also study color, lighting and composition, and how they shape the atmosphere of an animation.</p>
<p>Throughout the course you apply what you learned in practical exercises, creating backgrounds and adjusting them so they meet production and storytelling needs. The emphasis is on building a solid portfolio with projects ready for the animation market.</p>
<ul>
    <li>Beginner level</li>
    <li>Skill: Adobe Photoshop</li>
    <li>Language: Portuguese</li>
</ul>
        ]]></field>
    </record>
